sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Browser UI
  participant API as Next API
  participant AI as Provider Gateway
  participant MCP as McDonald MCP
  participant DB as SQLite
  User->>UI: 选择食物图片
  UI->>API: POST /api/ai/recognize
  API->>AI: 服务端凭据调用
  AI-->>API: 结构化食物候选
  API-->>UI: data/error
  alt 客户端路由在识别完成前切换
    UI->>UI: 会话级交接结构化候选（不含图片）
  end
  User->>UI: 发起营养对话或附近外卖请求
  UI->>API: POST /api/agent
  API-->>UI: SSE run.started / trace events (current turn only)
  API->>DB: 读取档案、餐食与可用记忆
  DB-->>API: safe context summaries
  API-->>UI: SSE step/tool/model started events
  API->>AI: 受控上下文调用 (stream when supported)
  AI-->>API: model deltas
  API-->>UI: SSE answer.delta + model.delta
  AI-->>API: 建议或工具意图
  API-->>UI: 建议、搜索结果或订单草案
  alt 当前消息明确要求点麦当劳
    API->>AI: 注入档案、记忆与可信菜单候选
    AI-->>API: 返回结构化商品选择
    API->>API: 校验单次建单、金额与商品参数
    API->>MCP: 计价并创建一笔未支付订单
    MCP-->>API: 订单号与临时支付入口
    API-->>UI: 展示选餐理由、金额和支付按钮
    UI-->>User: 用户自行打开支付入口
  else 普通营养咨询或意图不明确
    API-->>UI: 只返回建议，不创建订单
  end
  API-->>UI: SSE run.completed / run.failed + done
  User->>UI: 确认保存
  UI->>API: POST /api/meals
  API->>DB: 绑定 primary profile 后写入
  DB-->>API: 已保存记录
  API-->>UI: data/error
  API-->>UI: optional SSE activity events (label/status/duration only)
  UI-->>User: collapsible current-turn activity timeline
